## Codebase Discoveries
listOptions and selection helpers live in tree.go and are shared by get and tree. The get-only flag leaves the tree option empty. hidden and inactive must exclude PR searches so empty PR results do not print misleading --all hints. hasPullRequest requires decoded front matter, including when --all is present, and duplicate PR entries do not duplicate plan rows.

